   "date": "2026-10-25T03:24:12Z",
   "email": "person",
   "message": "SEB-301: researcher replaces Scout and planner, track A job rules, weekly scorecard (#675)\n\n- tools/gap_report.py: data gaps computed by code (no price, one source, disagreeing sources, stale retests, past quarantine)\n- tools/researcher.py + researcher.yml: one Sonnet call a week, 3 jobs into BACKLOG.md, refused by code if they break the rules\n- tools/job_shape.py: track A takes new-file jobs only; existing collectors, pages and methods are track B, the builder skips them\n- tools/run_agent_tests.py: runs every tests/agent_*.py in CI and as the builder's test\n- tools/scorecard.py + scorecard.yml: Sunday card on the \"Agent scorecard\" issue, with the 8 Nov kill-date count\n- removed scout.yml, weekly_planner.yml and their scripts; watchdog and daily status watch the researcher\n- CLAUDE.md, BACKLOG.md header and docs/aider_track.md say the same thing\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017TKMhU7YLPdTWA8YnphhaN\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"
