   "email": "person",
   "message": "SEB-384: home time control, the grid at any day since 2000 or any hour of the last 90 days (step 4, page) (#669)\n\n* SEB-384 step 4 (files): dollar map timeline, one file per year since 2000 and the last 90 days by the hour\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* SEB-384 step 4: home time control, the grid at any day since 2000 or any hour of the last 90 days\n\nReplaces the record-grew chart at the bottom of home and takes findings 01 and 02 off the home list. New words are empty copy.json keys until the writer PR is approved.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* SEB-384: map timeline also writes where the official rate landed after past breaks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* SEB-384: home shows where the official rate landed after past breaks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* SEB-384: a check that the map timeline files equal the stored files they come from\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* SEB-384: the map timeline check may read the landing history file\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* SEB-384: the record chart style check covers the page that still draws it\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Sebastian Roervig <sebastian.roervig@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>"
